## 7. Windows Unexpected Shutdowns

Host-side confirmation for anything that surfaces in #5 or #6.

```spl
index=<your_windows_system_index> (EventCode=41 OR EventCode=6008)
| stats count min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen by host EventCode
| sort 0 - count
| convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z" ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
```

